<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.guest.harvests ~ the comparator built through the vendored miner's own path

`lares mempalace harvest` builds the guest comparator from every harness transcript through the plain vendored miner (`mine --mode convos --wing <wing>`), carrying no Lares vocabulary. The discovery and staging live in python; this leg shells the lane and renders its report. `dry-run=true` previews; `wing=` and `project=` narrow it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ harvest · preview

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`harvest` params=`~ mine every transcript surface`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`preview` params=`dry-run/true wing/claude ~ preview one wing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ dry-run · wing · project

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`dry-run` params=`kind/switch ~ preview the harvest and write nothing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`wing` params=`takes/name ~ one wing alone`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`project` params=`takes/name ~ one project alone`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

